sequenceDiagram
    participant Op as Operator
    participant API as Express API
    participant Lock as Send Lock
    participant PW as Playwright
    participant LI as linkedin.com

    Op->>API: POST /api/outreach/:id/send-linkedin
    API->>API: check status in {approved, followup_due}
    API->>API: check expectedVersion matches stored version
    API->>API: check contact not already messaged in another campaign
    API->>Lock: acquire lock (campaignId:contactId:phase)
    API->>API: reserve status -> sending_initial / sending_followup
    API->>PW: send({ profileUrl, firstName, message })
    PW->>LI: goto(stored profile URL)
    alt login/checkpoint/authwall detected
        PW-->>API: throw "sign in required"
        API->>API: revert reservation to error, keep lock released
    else profile loaded
        PW->>PW: verify page title matches firstName
        PW->>LI: click Message
        PW->>PW: locate message composer
        PW->>PW: verify open conversation recipient matches profile name again
        PW->>PW: verify no InMail subject is required
        PW->>PW: fill composer, verify typed text == approved draft
        PW->>PW: verify Send button enabled
        PW->>LI: click Send
        PW-->>API: { sent: true, sentAt }
        API->>API: transition -> sent_initial / sent_followup
        API->>API: schedule follow-up (+5 business days) if initial
    end
    API->>Lock: release lock
    API-->>Op: result
